<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia stocks seen touch firmer, eyes on rates.</title>
<headline>Australia stocks seen touch firmer, eyes on rates.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------(Snapshot 8.45 a.m./2245 GMT)-----------------</p>
<p>AORD cl	    2653.4   -30.8   DJIA cl	7906.72   +16.26</p>
<p>SPI Sycom cl     2662.0    +6.0   US 30yr cl	6.54    +0.02</p>
